{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitFaithful","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitFaithful","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeInclInjective","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimit","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeWedderburnGeneral"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimit.H_lt_succ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimit.H_lt_succ","kind":"theorem","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitFaithful.lean#L100-L112","doc":"**Strict growth of the colimit filtration.** `H n < H (n+1)` for every `n` — the level\n`HeckeTowerWitness`'s rank-2 collapse cannot reach, and what bean `qou-p8yg` asks for. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimit.finrank_H","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimit.finrank_H","kind":"theorem","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitFaithful.lean#L92-L98","doc":"**Each level sits in the colimit with its full dimension** `(n+1)!`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimit.toSubmodule_H","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimit.toSubmodule_H","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitFaithful.lean#L88-L90","doc":"The filtration step, as a submodule, is the range of the linear map into the colimit. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimit.ofLimₐ_injective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimit.ofLimₐ_injective","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitFaithful.lean#L82-L85","doc":"The algebra map into the colimit is injective. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimit.ofLim_injective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimit.ofLim_injective","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitFaithful.lean#L74-L80","doc":"**Faithfulness.** The canonical map from level `n` into the colimit is injective, so `H n` is an\nisomorphic copy of `Hecke ℝ q q⁻¹ n` rather than merely its image. This is the question\n`HeckeColimit` and `HeckeColimitMarkovTrace` both flag as open. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimit.heckeInclLE_injective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimit.heckeInclLE_injective","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeColimitFaithful.lean#L62-L72","doc":"**Every transition map of the tower is injective**, not just the one-step inclusion. Induction\non the upper index; the successor step is a composition of two injections. ","signatureChunk":0}]}